+
+    /// Re-wraps live during resize at a bounded cadence. This preserves visible wrapping feedback without letting
+    /// AppKit trigger an unbounded `layoutLines()` storm for every frame of a window/split-view resize.
+    private func scheduleLiveWrapRelayout() {
